# Local AI Overrides (gitignored)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` and fill in machine/account-specific values.
`CLAUDE.local.md` is gitignored, so secrets and infra IDs never get committed.
Claude Code loads it automatically alongside CLAUDE.md.

## Database (MCP) branch IDs

<!-- Only needed if CLAUDE.md keeps the "Database Access Rules" block. -->

- development branchId: `br-xxxx-dev`
- production  branchId: `br-xxxx-prod`   # referenced only so the AI knows what NOT to touch

## Anything else machine-specific

- <local paths, ports, personal tokens read via env, etc.>
